            "block_content": "(a) An Employee appointed to serve as a judge or clerk of election within his or her Scheduled Weekly Tour will be excused for such absence, consistent with the needs of the business. When so excused, the Employee will be paid for such absence in the amount, if any, by which his or her pay for the period of absence within the Employee's Scheduled Daily Tour exceeds the compensation received for such election board service.",
